🧠 One-Line Memory Trick
filter      → Select
map         → Transform
flatMap     → Flatten
reduce      → Aggregate
collect     → Convert
groupingBy  → Group
toMap       → Map
distinct    → Remove Duplicates
sorted      → Sort

Predicate   → Test
Function    → Transform
Consumer    → Use
Supplier    → Provide


These are the most common Java 8 coding patterns typically asked in Senior Java, Spring Boot, Microservices, and Banking domain interviews.
